# Allyanna Accounting — Project Context

AI-driven multi-tenant accounting SaaS for Sint Maarten (SXM) compliance.

## Stack

Python (FastAPI), PostgreSQL, OpenAI GPT-4o, Next.js

## Non-negotiables

1. LLM never does financial math — Python `decimal` only
2. Every query scoped by `tenant_id`; Postgres RLS on all tenant tables
3. Tax rates/brackets/SZV caps from DB cache by `tax_year` + `country_code` (`SXM`), never hardcoded in formulas
4. Master Account can switch securely among sub-tenant business profiles
5. OCR/document intake is async; GPT-4o extracts structured fields into Pydantic validation

## Tax domain (SXM)

- TOT: flat 5% on gross taxable revenue (rate still sourced from tax tables, not formula literals)
- Wage tax: progressive brackets from official tables
- SZV: ZV/OV and AOV/AWW with employer/employee splits and monthly wage ceiling

